{"id": "2091443", "name": "רציונליים שאינם שלמים – X∩(ℚ∖ℤ)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 8px;\">רציונליים שאינם שלמים</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; line-height: 2;\">\\(\\displaystyle X=\\left\\{\\frac{{{CT:0}}}{{{CT:1}}},\\frac{{{CT:2}}}{{{CT:3}}},\\frac{{{CT:4}}}{{{CT:5}}},\\frac{{{CT:6}}}{{{CT:7}}},\\frac{{{CT:8}}}{{{CT:9}}}\\right\\}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">התשובה</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">הזינו את התוצאה כקבוצה. בכל וריאנט יש גם שלמים וגם רציונליים שאינם שלמים.</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\\(\\displaystyle X\\cap(\\mathbb Q\\setminus\\mathbb Z)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; color: #665f6b; font-size: 13px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q1_SETS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>שבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a/b\\)</span> הוא מספר שלם אם ורק אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b\\mid a\\)</span>, כלומר אם השארית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span>\\(b\\) היא אפס.</p>\n<p>השאריות בחמשת השברים הן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;\">\\({{CT:0}}\\bmod {{CT:1}}={{CT:10}}\\), \\(\\quad {{CT:2}}\\bmod {{CT:3}}={{CT:11}}\\)<br>\\({{CT:4}}\\bmod {{CT:5}}={{CT:12}}\\), \\(\\quad {{CT:6}}\\bmod {{CT:7}}={{CT:13}}\\), \\(\\quad {{CT:8}}\\bmod {{CT:9}}={{CT:14}}\\)</div>\n<p>נשאיר רק את השברים שעבורם השארית אינה אפס. לכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\">\\(\\displaystyle X\\cap(\\mathbb Q\\setminus\\mathbb Z)={{CT:15}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">\n<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>\n</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 32, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "הזינו קבוצה באמצעות סוגריים מסולסלים { }", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "correct:if equal(ta,ans1) then true else false; opposite:if equal(wrongInt,ans1) then true else false; allwrong:if equal(allVals,ans1) then true else false;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "correct", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "opposite", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.35, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">זיהית נכון אילו שברים הם שלמים, אבל נדרשו דווקא הרציונליים שאינם שלמים.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "allwrong", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.2, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">כללת את כל איברי הקבוצה בלי לבצע את החיתוך עם \\(\\mathbb Q\\setminus\\mathbb Z\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "a5", "allVals", "b1", "b2", "b3", "b4", "b5", "densrc", "ks", "numsrc", "ord", "q1", "q2", "q3", "q4", "q5", "rem1", "rem2", "rem3", "rem4", "rem5", "ta", "wrongInt"], "nvariants": 50}